</div>
<p local-id=3D"994f75c3f649">The problem register identifies fragmented inf=
ormation and the absence of a reliable single source of truth as the centra=
l business problem. Several additional problems, including duplicate admini=
stration, inconsistent records and slow reporting, appear to result from or=
 be intensified by this central problem.</p>
